WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:07.100
I will be giving this Saturday the keynote
address at the grassroots radio conference

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.740
in Rochester, New York.

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:09.900
I hope you'll join me there.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.759
I've been going to this conference off and
on for many years.

00:00:12.759 --> 00:00:18.859
I remember going once years ago in Humboldt
County, California up there about four hours,

00:00:18.859 --> 00:00:23.830
roughly four hours North, as I recall from
San Francisco, a real cannabis country.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:25.210
Very interesting to see that.

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:30.380
Uh, another time I went to the grassroots
radio conference in Kansas city, Missouri.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:35.700
Uh, got some great barbecue, met some great
people and this year the conference is in

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:41.570
Rochester, New York at, I will be speaking
at 4:00 PM local time.

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:43.620
That's Eastern time on Saturday.

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:45.550
It is a media conference.

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:50.980
So the panels and the sessions are mostly
based around media and independent media.

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:54.360
It's really great stuff and it would be great
for you to attend the entire conference.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:01:00.460
But I've also asked, uh, the GRC to make tickets
available just to the keynote.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:03.270
If people want to come and see that it's only
10 bucks.

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:07.610
I'm guessing there's another dollar or so
service charge or something like that.

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:11.160
4:00 PM this Saturday, October.

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:12.160
What is the date?

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:13.640
Is that the uh, the fourth, right?

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:16.290
No, the fifth Saturday is the fifth I believe.

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:20.610
Man, I'm getting today's the first, second,
third, fourth, yeah, whatever the date is

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:21.610
on Saturday.

00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:28.930
That's the date and all the info is@grassrootsradioconference.org
I would love to see you there.

00:01:28.930 --> 00:01:35.220
I will speak about media, I will speak about
fake news attacks on media and all of that

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:39.280
stuff and then there will be an opportunity
to ask questions as well.

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:41.560
Great times to be had by all.

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:45.650
I've never been to Rochester so I'm looking
forward to it.

00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:50.570
And once again, the website where you can
find all of the information is grassroots

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:52.870
radio, conference.org

